<title>USA: CollaGenex launches first product.</title>
<headline>CollaGenex launches first product.</headline>
<dateline>NEWTOWN, Pa. 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>CollaGenex Pharmaceuticals Inc said Monday that it has signed an exclusive marketing agreement for the Parke-Davis Division of Warner-Lambert Co to promote it first product, Ponstel, to the professional dental community.</p>
<p>Ponstel is a nonsteroidal anti-inflammatory drug indicated for the relief of moderate pain.</p>
